OL,3,GNEWSA'Every avenue being explored' for
OL,4,Aairshow's return
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Every possible avenue" is being
OL,7,Fexplored to bring back a city's annual
OL,8,Fairshow, its council says.
OL,10,FThe event in Sunderland, which ran for
OL,11,Fdecades, drew hundreds of thousands of
OL,12,Fpeople to the seafront at Roker.
OL,14,FIt last took place in 2019 with
OL,15,Fsubsequent displays called off due to
OL,16,Fthe Covid-19 pandemic before the then
OL,17,FLabour-led local authority stated in
OL,18,F2022 the show had been cancelled
OL,19,Findefinitely as part of efforts to make
OL,20,Fthe city carbon neutral.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
